#, kde-format
msgctxt "NAME OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your names"
msgstr "Softastur"

#, kde-format
msgctxt "EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS"
msgid "Your emails"
msgstr "alministradores@softastur.org"

#: DriverManager.cpp:248 Module.cpp:220
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"The package system could not be initialized, your configuration may be "
"broken."
msgstr ""
"El sistema de paquetes nun pudo aniciase, la configuración podría tar "
"rota."

#: DriverManager.cpp:253
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"Another application seems to be using the package system at this time. You "
"must close all other package managers before you will be able to install or "
"remove any packages."
msgstr ""
"Paez qu'hai otra aplicación usando'l sistema de paquetes nesti momentu. "
"Has zarrar los demás xestores de paquetes enantes de ser a instalar o "
"desaniciar cualesquier paquete."

#: DriverManager.cpp:260
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"You do not have enough disk space in the directory at %1 to continue with "
"this operation."
msgstr ""
"Nun tienes abondu espaciu nel direutoriu %1 pa siguir con esta operación."

#: DriverManager.cpp:266
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Could not download packages"
msgstr "Nun pudieron baxase los paquetes"

#: DriverManager.cpp:269
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "An error occurred while applying changes:"
msgstr "Asocedió un fallu mentanto s'aplicaben los cambeos:"

#: DriverManager.cpp:273
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"This operation cannot continue since proper authorization was not provided"
msgstr ""
"Esta operación nun pue siguir darréu que nun s'apurrió l'autorización"
" afayadiza"

#: DriverManager.cpp:277
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"It appears that the QApt worker has either crashed or disappeared. Please "
"report a bug to the QApt maintainers"
msgstr ""
"Paez que'l trabayador de QApt cascó o desapaeció. Informa del fallu a los "
"caltenedores de QApt"

#: DriverManager.cpp:285
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"The following package has not been verified by its author. Downloading "
"untrusted packages has been disallowed by your current configuration."
msgid_plural ""
"The following packages have not been verified by their authors. Downloading "
"untrusted packages has been disallowed by your current configuration."
msgstr[0] ""
"L'autor del paquete de darréu nun lu verificó. La to configuración actual "
"nun permite la descarga de paquetes que nun son d'enfotu."
msgstr[1] ""

#: DriverManager.cpp:298
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"The package \"%1\" has not been found among your software sources. "
"Therefore, it cannot be installed. "
msgstr ""
"El paquete «%1» nun s'alcontró ente los tos oríxenes de software. "
"Poro, nun pue instalase."

#: DriverManager.cpp:310
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Media Change Required"
msgstr "Ríquese'l cambéu de medios"

#: DriverManager.cpp:311
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Please insert %1 into <filename>%2</filename>"
msgstr "Inxerta %1 en <filename>%2</filename>"

#: DriverManager.cpp:320
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Warning - Unverified Software"
msgstr "Alvertencia - Software ensin verificar"

#: DriverManager.cpp:322
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"The following piece of software cannot be verified. <warning>Installing "
"unverified software represents a security risk, as the presence of "
"unverifiable software can be a sign of tampering.</warning> Do you wish to "
"continue?"
msgid_plural ""
"The following pieces of software cannot be verified. <warning>Installing "
"unverified software represents a security risk, as the presence of "
"unverifiable software can be a sign of tampering.</warning> Do you wish to "
"continue?"
msgstr[0] ""
"El software de darréu nun pue verificase. <warning>Instalar software "
"que nun se verificó representa un riesgu pa la seguranza darréu "
"que la so presencia pue ser seña de manipulación. </warning>¿Desees "
"siguir?"
msgstr[1] ""

#: DriverManager.cpp:341
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Configuration File Changed"
msgstr "Camudó'l ficheru de configuración"

#: DriverManager.cpp:343
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label Notifies a config file change"
msgid ""
"A new version of the configuration file <filename>%1</filename> is "
"available, but your version has been modified. Would you like to keep your "
"current version or install the new version?"
msgstr ""
"Hai una versión nueva del ficheru de configuración <filename>%1</filename> "
"pero la vieya modificóse. ¿Prestaríate caltener la versión actual o instalar"
" la "
"nueva?"

#: DriverManager.cpp:348
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action Use the new config file"
msgid "Use New Version"
msgstr "Usar la nueva"

#: DriverManager.cpp:349
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action Keep the old config file"
msgid "Keep Old Version"
msgstr "Caltener la vieya"

